Complete Delivery Infrastructure, Dispatch, Notifications, Geospatial Intelligence & Operational Management

You are acting as a Senior Backend Architect, Distributed Systems Engineer, Geospatial Engineer, Logistics Product Architect, Mobile Realtime Engineer, and Senior Full-Stack Developer.

Your mission is to architect, audit, implement, and integrate the complete operational delivery infrastructure of ROVA.

Do not treat Rova as a basic delivery application.

ROVA is intended to become an urban logistics platform operating through city-based delivery networks. It must intelligently manage customers, couriers, delivery requests, geospatial eligibility, pricing, dispatch, courier acceptance, live tracking, notifications, delivery lifecycle, cancellations, incidents, payment states, operational administration, and system recovery.

The objective is to implement a reliable, production-minded infrastructure inspired by the operational principles of platforms such as Lalamove, Yango Delivery, Uber Direct, and similar logistics services, without copying proprietary code or assuming access to their private architecture.

Build Rova’s own system, adapted to its markets, operating conditions, existing codebase, product design, and future scalability.

