17. All operational actions must be authorized, validated, and performed server-side.
18. All critical delivery events must be auditable.
19. Every asynchronous task must have a defined failure and retry strategy.
20. The architecture must support real-world operation, not merely a visual demonstration.

The goal is a working, integrated system, not a collection of attractive screens.

