* Couriers may only access their authorized assignments and offers.
* Couriers may not modify another courier’s position.
* Couriers may not claim arbitrary delivery assignments.
* Customers may not alter delivery states.
* Administrators must have appropriate privileges.
* Financial operations must require privileged server-side validation.
* Privileged database credentials must never be exposed.
* Realtime subscriptions must be properly scoped.
* Notification data must be restricted.
* GPS data must be protected.
* Proof-of-delivery evidence must be access-controlled.

Audit every privileged operation.

